# --- Citation information (LAYERS.md "Relationship with derived projects") ---

cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EZR and RStudio runtime environment (R 4.6.1, English edition)"
message: "If you publish results obtained with this environment, please cite it using the information below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Imai"
    given-names: "Kei"
    email: "keiimai1220@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "The University of Tokyo, Japan"
abstract: >-
  An environment that adds EZR (RcmdrPlugin.EZR) to r_46x_en, a runtime environment template for reproducible analysis (R 4.6.1, Docker, renv, RStudio Server).
  EZR is opened from the RStudio session; its screen is drawn on a virtual display inside the container and shown in the browser through the RStudio Server proxy.
  On both Mac and Windows, Docker Desktop is the only thing to install on the computer.
  This is the English edition: the EZR menus and the instructions for users are in English.
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-16"
keywords:
  - reproducible research
  - R
  - EZR
  - RStudio
